{
    "title": "Solitaire - Classic Card Games",
    "description": "<b>Solitaire by MobilityWare is the original & best free Solitaire card game!</b>\r\n\r\nExperience the timeless fun of Solitaire with MobilityWare\u2019s Solitaire game, the most popular and original Solitaire card game on the Play Store. Join <b><u>over 100 million Solitaire players</u></b> enjoying the ultimate Solitaire card game experience.\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love Klondike Solitaire Card Games:\r\nClassic Solitaire card games with a Modern Twist:\r\n\u2660 Play free, classic Klondike Solitaire with stunning graphics, smooth animations, and a user-friendly Solitaire interface.\r\n\u2660 Use Solitaire hints and unlimited undos to enhance your Solitaire card games skills.\r\n\u2660 Effortlessly move Solitaire cards with intuitive tap and drag controls.\r\n\u2660 Enjoy Klondike Solitaire card games for free - no cash required.\r\n\u2660 Regular Solitaire updates provide fresh content and exciting features for our free Solitaire card games.\r\n\r\nSolitaire Daily Challenges & Rewards:\r\n\u2665 Take on unique Solitaire Daily Challenges and earn crowns.\r\n\u2665 Cash in on the free Solitaire rewards! Win crowns each month to collect exclusive trophies.\r\n\u2665 Replay daily deals for endless classic Solitaire fun and rewards!\r\n\u2665 Join free weekly Solitaire events to earn badges and unlock exclusive card games rewards.\r\n\r\nEngaging & Addictive Solitaire:\r\n\u2666 Choose Draw 1 card or Draw 3 card modes of Klondike Solitaire for varying difficulty.\r\n\u2666 Play winning Solitaire deals that test your strategy and card games skills.\r\n\u2666 Train your brain with new and challenging Solitaire card puzzles daily.\r\n\r\nBrain-Boosting Solitaire Fun:\r\n\u2663 Perfect for all Solitaire skill levels, free classic Solitaire offers strategic, engaging puzzles.\r\n\u2663 Great for Solitaire fans and brain game enthusiasts seeking to sharpen their minds.\r\n\u2663 Daily Solitaire challenges and card puzzles provide a new Solitaire card games experience every day.\r\n\u2663 Utilize free hints and unlimited Solitaire undos to enhance your Solitaire card games skills.\r\n\r\nCustomizable & Convenient:\r\n\u2660 Track your progress with the free Solitaire Statistics Tracker.\r\n\u2660 Personalize Solitaire cards and tables to match your style.\r\n\u2660 Upload custom photos for your Solitaire playing cards and background.\r\n\u2660 Choose standard Solitaire or Vegas card scoring.\r\n\u2660 Available in Left-handed Mode for added comfort.\r\n\u2660 Enjoy free classic Solitaire card games on your phone or tablet, in both portrait or landscape orientations.\r\n\u2660 Unwind with Solitaire card games in Dark mode.\r\n\u2660 Play classic Solitaire card games anywhere, anytime \u2013 online or offline, no WIFI needed.\r\n\r\nMultiplayer Solitaire & Leaderboards:\r\n\u2665 Compete with Solitaire friends and players worldwide in multiplayer mode! \r\n\u2665 Share your victories and compete with friends on the Solitaire card games leaderboards.\r\n\r\nWhy MobilityWare Solitaire Card Games?\r\nCrafted by Solitaire experts, MobilityWare offers the most authentic Klondike Solitaire card game experience. As the original developers who brought the classic Solitaire card game to mobile, we continually update our Klondike Solitaire games with the features you love. No cash required. Enjoy the ultimate classic Solitaire card experience for free.\r\n\r\nIs MobilityWare Solitaire for You?\r\nIf you love free classic card games like Spider Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, or other MobilityWare card games favorites like Castle Solitaire, Mahjong Solitaire, and Pyramid Solitaire, you\u2019ll love Klondike Solitaire!\r\n\r\nJoin millions of Solitaire players and enjoy the best free Solitaire card games experience available on Android. Download now and start playing the ultimate classic Solitaire card game for free!\r\n\r\nhttp://www.mobilityware.com\r\nhttp://www.facebook.com/mobilitywaresolitaire\r\nhttp://www.mobilityware.com/support.php\r\n\r\nLIKE US on Facebook\r\nhttp://www.facebook.com/mobilitywaresolitaire",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Solitaire by MobilityWare is the original &amp; best free Solitaire card game!</b><br><br>Experience the timeless fun of Solitaire with MobilityWare\u2019s Solitaire game, the most popular and original Solitaire card game on the Play Store. Join <b><u>over 100 million Solitaire players</u></b> enjoying the ultimate Solitaire card game experience.<br><br>Why You&#39;ll Love Klondike Solitaire Card Games:<br>Classic Solitaire card games with a Modern Twist:<br>\u2660 Play free, classic Klondike Solitaire with stunning graphics, smooth animations, and a user-friendly Solitaire interface.<br>\u2660 Use Solitaire hints and unlimited undos to enhance your Solitaire card games skills.<br>\u2660 Effortlessly move Solitaire cards with intuitive tap and drag controls.<br>\u2660 Enjoy Klondike Solitaire card games for free - no cash required.<br>\u2660 Regular Solitaire updates provide fresh content and exciting features for our free Solitaire card games.<br><br>Solitaire Daily Challenges &amp; Rewards:<br>\u2665 Take on unique Solitaire Daily Challenges and earn crowns.<br>\u2665 Cash in on the free Solitaire rewards! Win crowns each month to collect exclusive trophies.<br>\u2665 Replay daily deals for endless classic Solitaire fun and rewards!<br>\u2665 Join free weekly Solitaire events to earn badges and unlock exclusive card games rewards.<br><br>Engaging &amp; Addictive Solitaire:<br>\u2666 Choose Draw 1 card or Draw 3 card modes of Klondike Solitaire for varying difficulty.<br>\u2666 Play winning Solitaire deals that test your strategy and card games skills.<br>\u2666 Train your brain with new and challenging Solitaire card puzzles daily.<br><br>Brain-Boosting Solitaire Fun:<br>\u2663 Perfect for all Solitaire skill levels, free classic Solitaire offers strategic, engaging puzzles.<br>\u2663 Great for Solitaire fans and brain game enthusiasts seeking to sharpen their minds.<br>\u2663 Daily Solitaire challenges and card puzzles provide a new Solitaire card games experience every day.<br>\u2663 Utilize free hints and unlimited Solitaire undos to enhance your Solitaire card games skills.<br><br>Customizable &amp; Convenient:<br>\u2660 Track your progress with the free Solitaire Statistics Tracker.<br>\u2660 Personalize Solitaire cards and tables to match your style.<br>\u2660 Upload custom photos for your Solitaire playing cards and background.<br>\u2660 Choose standard Solitaire or Vegas card scoring.<br>\u2660 Available in Left-handed Mode for added comfort.<br>\u2660 Enjoy free classic Solitaire card games on your phone or tablet, in both portrait or landscape orientations.<br>\u2660 Unwind with Solitaire card games in Dark mode.<br>\u2660 Play classic Solitaire card games anywhere, anytime \u2013 online or offline, no WIFI needed.<br><br>Multiplayer Solitaire &amp; Leaderboards:<br>\u2665 Compete with Solitaire friends and players worldwide in multiplayer mode! <br>\u2665 Share your victories and compete with friends on the Solitaire card games leaderboards.<br><br>Why MobilityWare Solitaire Card Games?<br>Crafted by Solitaire experts, MobilityWare offers the most authentic Klondike Solitaire card game experience. As the original developers who brought the classic Solitaire card game to mobile, we continually update our Klondike Solitaire games with the features you love. No cash required. Enjoy the ultimate classic Solitaire card experience for free.<br><br>Is MobilityWare Solitaire for You?<br>If you love free classic card games like Spider Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, or other MobilityWare card games favorites like Castle Solitaire, Mahjong Solitaire, and Pyramid Solitaire, you\u2019ll love Klondike Solitaire!<br><br>Join millions of Solitaire players and enjoy the best free Solitaire card games experience available on Android. Download now and start playing the ultimate classic Solitaire card game for free!<br><br>http://www.mobilityware.com<br>http://www.facebook.com/mobilitywaresolitaire<br>http://www.mobilityware.com/support.php<br><br>LIKE US on Facebook<br>http://www.facebook.com/mobilitywaresolitaire",
